# 基线路线（golden.py）：进局喝掉腰带第 1、2 列各一瓶，开关物品栏，站定后存盘：存档里腰带与物品的变化是存档基线要盯的
# Baseline route (golden.py): drink one potion each from belt columns 1 and 2, open and close the inventory, then stand still and save: the belt and item changes in the save are what the save baseline watches
name golden_belt
save warlock
env DM_GAME_SEED=305419896
timeout 180

enter_game
sleep 1
press LEFT
expect_state belt0=0
press UP
expect_state belt1=0
press PLUS
expect_state panels~=PlayerInventoryExpansionLayout
press B
sleep 1
save_now timeout=8
sleep 1
quit
check no_red
check save_pairs
